# Sisko is the one Officer his controller controls, so a spell cast free from the five exiled cards needs mana value 1 or
# less, and the mana value is the spell's as cast, not the exiled card's (CR 608.2g, 709.3b). Wear // Tear is mana value 3
# in exile, yet Tear ({W}) is mana value 1 and may be cast: it destroys Bot2's Weaponize the Monsters. Wear ({1}{R}, mana
# value 2) is not a way offered, and Grizzly Bears (2) is not offered at all.

